sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    actor A as Administrador
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant IAM as iam
    participant BOOK as booking-reservation
    participant FLEET as fleet-maintenance
    participant PAY as payment-billing

    Note over C,PAY: Reserva con pago por transferencia bancaria (SEQ-03 + SEQ-04)

    rect rgb(238,244,255)
    Note right of C: 1 - Crear la reserva
    C->>GW: POST /reservations
    GW->>IAM: Validar JWT (REST)
    IAM-->>GW: Claims válidos
    GW->>BOOK: POST /reservations
    BOOK->>FLEET: GET /vehicles/:id/availability
    FLEET-->>BOOK: Disponibilidad
    BOOK->>BOOK: Reservation.status = PENDING_PAYMENT
    BOOK--)A: ReservationCreated -> notifica al administrador
    end

    rect rgb(238,255,238)
    Note right of C: 2 - Cargar el comprobante de transferencia
    C->>GW: POST /payments (comprobante)
    GW->>IAM: Validar JWT
    IAM-->>GW: Claims válidos
    GW->>PAY: POST /payments
    PAY->>BOOK: GET /reservations/:id (validar monto)
    BOOK-->>PAY: total_amount
    PAY->>PAY: Payment.status = PENDING_REVIEW
    PAY--)BOOK: PaymentReceiptUploaded
    BOOK->>BOOK: Reservation.status = PENDING_REVIEW
    PAY--)A: Notificación "comprobante por revisar"
    end

    rect rgb(255,248,238)
    Note right of A: 3 - Revisión del comprobante (administrador)
    alt Aprobado
        A->>GW: PATCH /payments/:id/approve
        GW->>PAY: PATCH /payments/:id/approve
        PAY->>PAY: Payment.status = APPROVED
        PAY--)BOOK: PaymentCompleted
        PAY->>PAY: InvoiceGenerated (factura)
        BOOK->>BOOK: Reservation.status = CONFIRMED
        BOOK--)C: Notificación "pago aprobado"
    else Rechazado - reintento permitido
        A->>GW: PATCH /payments/:id/reject (RETRY_ALLOWED)
        GW->>PAY: PATCH /payments/:id/reject
        PAY->>PAY: Payment.status = REJECTED
        PAY--)BOOK: PaymentRejected
        BOOK->>BOOK: Reservation.status = PENDING_PAYMENT
        BOOK--)C: Notificación "rechazado, puede reintentar"
    else Rechazado - cancelar reserva
        A->>GW: PATCH /payments/:id/reject (RESERVATION_CANCELLED)
        GW->>PAY: PATCH /payments/:id/reject
        PAY->>PAY: Payment.status = REJECTED
        PAY--)BOOK: PaymentRejected
        BOOK->>BOOK: Reservation.status = CANCELLED
        BOOK--)C: Notificación "reserva cancelada"
    end
    end
